# The first link records the libraries the program needs, the second one is
# cached by sbt under the output key
> nativeLink
> nativeLink
> forgetToolchainRun
> nativeLink
> checkToolchainSkipped
> run

# After clean, sbt restores the program, the build cache keeps its libraries
> clean
> nativeLink
> checkToolchainSkipped
> run

# Without its libraries, the program links again
> deleteLibraries
> nativeLink
> checkToolchainRan
> run
